This local client uses exact pinned noble post-quantum 0.7.1, noble curves 2.4.0,
and noble hashes 2.4.0 sources acquired during L11. Respective MIT licenses
and author notices are retained. Bare package import specifiers alone are
rewritten to local relative imports; upstream arithmetic is unchanged.

The selected client profile is SLH-DSA-SHA2-128s external pure signing. Other
upstream exports are dependencies, not exposed product profiles. See the L25
source closure and task for hashes, interop checks and limitations.
